-- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `s 899(1) the court may sanction the compromise or arrangement` TRUE 10 10 1000 749 EQUALS JUST FALSE; the votes fall short of the "if" on which the court may sanction, and an unmet "if" on a power the text gives answers NOTHING, not JUST FALSE (name-test sweep, fork F27)
#ASSERT `s 899(1) the court may sanction the compromise or arrangement` TRUE 10 10 1000 749 EQUALS NOTHING
