-- s 899(3): a sanctioned compromise or arrangement binds the creditors or class, members or class, the company, and (company being wound up) the liquidator and contributories
#ASSERT `s 899(3) the compromise or arrangement is binding on the person` FALSE `s 899(3) the company` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 899(3) the compromise or arrangement is binding on the person` TRUE `s 899(3) a creditor of the creditors or class concerned` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 899(3) the compromise or arrangement is binding on the person` TRUE `s 899(3) a member of the members or class concerned` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 899(3) the compromise or arrangement is binding on the person` TRUE `s 899(3) the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
